    "limits": [
      "Production summary omits uniform and TEST-majority controls and zero-support classes. Supply the verified additions separately and date them; do not silently rewrite the original or call the supplement fully preregistered.",
      "Control names and per-schema majority intent were prospective. One-hot probabilities, first-index uniform hard ties and exact schema/tie implementation were not all frozen as control conventions; report these descriptive choices explicitly. TEST-majority is a label-informed oracle, not a fitted deployable candidate.",
      "NLL is exact logit log-sum-exp for the model. One-hot controls have mathematical +infinity (640 and 634 zero-gold-probability rows); the public probability-only EPSILON=1e-9 convention instead gives 14.169754418424896 and 14.036912970752162 nats. Label both conventions; never mix them silently.",
      "Uniform hard first-index scoring is 296/936, whereas independent random-draw expected accuracy is 0.1610695631528965. Its expected paired change is 0.8539943741209565 and both-correct is 0.024307001093920925; high change alone is not evidence of understanding.",
      "All 574 source records and 936 question occurrences are retained by ordinal identity; this documents population has no repeated source IDs, ID/question keys or semantic requests. A no-deduplication policy must not be described as observed duplicate rows in this run.",
      "Three task-qualified candidate classes have zero gold support: credit-reporting fraud_alerts_or_freezes and unable_to_get_report, and student-loan getting_a_loan. Their accuracy/recall is undefined, not zero. Small/perfect/zero observed strata remain descriptive; n<30 is not a registered scientific threshold.",
      "The 395 pairs are same-schema different-input/different-label observational pairs with 790 distinct question occurrences, not minimal interventions or equivalence classes. Response change and both-correct are separate descriptive counts, not aggregate consistency. Questions can share a source record; no independent-question significance or confidence interval is established.",
      "The published native endpoint uses trained LoRA/pointer-head weights, different rendering/readout and shipped T=2.3510958125672174. Its documents-v1 TEST training family is in distribution. Only same-source descriptive context is permitted; no matched paired native vectors were supplied or located by the prior audit, and published docs1_test NLL is absent.",
      "Only candidate logits are saved. Full-vocabulary finiteness is supported by pinned producer checks and completed receipts, not independently replayable from these saved operands. Rehashing and token reconstruction do not prove historical hardware arithmetic or freedom from pretraining contamination.",
      "This is one finite public TEST cell, without TEST fitting or selection in this review; it does not establish future generalization, scaling, mechanistic input use, a training effect, or a new quality threshold. Parent publication and acceptance-state handling remain separate."
    ]
